=== ATTRIBUTION — third-party credit ===

peppy / ppy Pty Ltd — osu!
    This renderer reproduces osu! gameplay, timing, judgment, scoring and HUD
    behaviour by porting logic from osu! by Dean Herbert (peppy) and ppy:
      - github.com/ppy/osu            (MIT)
      - github.com/ppy/osu-framework  (MIT)
    Ports are behavioural/algorithmic re-implementations in Python; the exact
    C# sources are cited in the module and function docstrings they came from.
    No osu! game assets are bundled — osu!'s skins, beatmaps, audio and default
    art are CC BY-NC and are NOT included here; this repo ships only original
    or procedurally-generated art.
  Ports cover osu!taiko gameplay, judgment, scoring and HUD logic from
  osu.Game.Rulesets.Taiko and osu.Game (Argon HUD components), MIT.

danser-go — Wieku (Sebastian Krajewski)
    github.com/Wieku/danser-go  (GPL-3.0)
    danser-go's rendering architecture was studied as the behavioural
    reference while building these in-house engines, and the R3D bot invokes
    danser-go directly to generate some preview thumbnails. Grateful credit to
    Wieku and the danser contributors.

